vement\u2014but with bats instead of monkeys! Jump, climb, and bounce around the map using nothing but your hands\n\nBatz features multiple custom game modes to switch up the action, including speed wall, horror, king of the hill, only up, and so many others! You can also visit the shop to customize your bat and style your character before exploring and chasing your friends across a variety of unique, vertically driven maps.\n\nI will keep constantly updating the game and adding more content over time. I'm always listening to your suggestions and feedback to make it better, so feel free to share your ideas. Thanks for checking it out, and I hope you enjoy playing Batz!", "short_description": "Welcome to Batz! A fun, small VR game that uses Gorilla Tag\u2019s movement system \u2014 but with bats, the animal! No big story here, just a goofy, simple, and fun game. Hope you enjoy it!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1SisxDzvLril_D3JlkVMlFMFCmr1Cs6tqzSAqFBQG4DM/view", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Light VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://batzwebsite.carrd.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "39916836661296815"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1253